cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LemonAId, please cite it as below."
title: "LemonAId: a local data-readiness planner for research laboratories"
type: software
version: "0.6"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
license: BSD-2-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/SerranoLab/LemonAId"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, local web application that takes a laboratory's project
  inventory and reports how far each dataset reaches, which metadata the
  inventory lacks, which projects are closest to shareable, and the evidence-
  backed checks needed before data can be found and reused. Includes a
  sample-sheet validator, an FCS header reader matched to a reagent inventory,
  and a graph export with provenance on every edge.
authors:
